Accepted limiting structure

>  <SOURCE_REFERENCES>
["https://github.com/uiocompcat/tmQMg/tree/e1dc9887b8f20a217a1db6ca972d726bcbaab45b"]

>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Accepted limiting structure. The Lewis form with neutral Mo and three neutral azo ligands retains the three N=N bonds in the same-ID CSD. The three input ligands also have similar N–N geometries. This is a formal representation; The diamagnetism and metal–ligand orbital mixing reported for 2a do not determine unique localized oxidation states. Localized 36 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

>  <UPSTREAM_COMPARISON>
Not equivalent

>  <SPIN_REVIEW>
Solution proton NMR of the same species, 2a, supports diamagnetism, Consistent with a singlet

